"peer_disclosure_id": "nvda_2024_1A_D035",
"relationship": "same_topic",
"comparison": "AMD and NVIDIA both highlight the vulnerability of their operations to natural disasters due to geographic concentration, particularly in California and Asia. AMD states that 'extreme weather events and natural disasters can also disrupt the ability of our suppliers to deliver expected manufacturing parts,' while NVIDIA specifies that its 'corporate headquarters... and a portion of our research and development activities are located in California... making our operations vulnerable to natural disasters such as earthquakes, wildfires.' Both companies recognize that disasters in these specific regions can impact their core operations and supplier delivery capabilities.",
